ause some formulations do not contain prescription drugs. \r\nMr. Heredia has a problematic form of Acne Rosacea and a very sensitive skin. The treatment of this peculiar pathology involves the mandatory use of sunscreens (even indoors) and proper cleansers, beyond the medication, which in his case is tretinoin.\r\n\r\nAll the best European industrialized sunscreens and cleansers have been tried over many years without success, due to Mr. Heredia\'s intolerance to most cream-building ingredients, surfactants and preservatives that are present in commercial products, due to their long shelf life.\r\n\r\nOnly after years of trial and error, and by repeatedly exchanging ingredients in specifically compounded formulations, was the patient finally able to overcome this problem and  greatly improve his condition.\r\n\r\nThe reversal to industrialized creams and sunscreens will not be possible. It would certainly be a much easier option, but unfortunately this is not applicable to Mr. Heredia’s case. Doing so would cause a drawback in his medical condition, which is now stabilized.\r\n\r\nI expect my comments and concerns to be analyzed by a physician working with the insurance company. I reckon Mr. Heredia\'s case implies deviations from the norm, but they are necessary for his health condition.\r\n\r\nMost sincerely, \r\n\r\nLuiz Freitas, MD\r\n\r\n\r\n',NULL,'mmicheloto',NULL,'',0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL),(3339,_binary '\0','zz-declaracao pre op','zz-declaracao pre op',NULL,'2024-03-29 15:18:56','\n\n\n\n\nAo colega Cardiologista dr. Luís César,\n\n\nA paciente Goretti Batistella será submetida a cirurgia de plástica de face (ritidoplastia) e lipoaspiração de porte médio, no dia 25 de outubro de 2019.\nCom em cirurgias prévias da paciente, anestesia será geral endovenosa (Propofol) e a estimativa aproximada de tempo operatório é de 4:30 horas. A paciente deverá pernoitar no hospital.\nEncontro-me disponível para mais informações, se achar necessárias.\n\nAbraços,\n\nLuiz\n\ncell/w.app (19) 998417729\n\n',NULL,'freitasadm',NULL,'',0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL),(3342,_binary '\0','ZZ-DMAE-ULTRA-DESC-NOV2019-G30','ZZ-DMAE-ULTRA-DESC-NOV2019-G30',NULL,'2020-07-12 00:29:51','Loção Extra Firmadora DMAE Ultra \n\nB. Hydraintense 6,0%\nRetinol UTMF 1,0%\nDMAE Bitart. 4,0%\nB. Démerane qsp 30mL\nAplicar 2x ao dia, 1 minuto antes dos cremes do Dia e da Noite, \napenas nas bochechas e em todo o pescoço.\n',NULL,'freitasadm',NULL,'',0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL),(3344,_binary '\0','TRANS-D-15G','DESO-15G',NULL,'2024-10-02 15:08:58','Sérum Desonide 15g    \r\n\r\nDesonida 0,015%\r\nB. Neolipossome VC 6,0% \r\nB. Neodeline 6,0%\r\nSérum B. Vitessence VC Plus qsp 15g\r\nApós lavar a pele, aplique-o apenas nas manchas a noite, ou \r\nem outro horário recomendado, meio minuto antes dos cremes.\r\n',NULL,'mmicheloto',NULL,'era 0,01% até 10/01/22, aumentei para 0,015%\r\n',0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL),(3345,_binary '','CLAREADOR INTIMO','W-CLAREADOR-INTIMO-8-G30',NULL,'2026-05-30 17:26:58','Loção Clareadora de Virilhas e axilas\r\n\r\nHidroquisan 8,0% \r\nNeolipossome 6,0%\r\nVitessence 6,0%\r\nB. Aquelane qsp 30 g\r\nAplique uma vez ao dia, apenas nas áreas indicadas e \r\nseguindo a orientação médica. Evite contato direto com \r\nmucosas ou genitais. Se ocorre irritação, interrompa \r\no uso e contate o SAC Revskin.\r\n',NULL,'freitasadm',NULL,'',0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL),(3347,_binary '','METRONIDAZOL 15G','METRONIDAZOL-0,75-ROSACEA- 15G',NULL,'2026-05-25 18:38:32','Gel Metronidazol para Rosácea\r\n\r\nMetronidazol 0,75%\r\nNeolipossome VC 6,0% \r\nNeodeline 6,0%\r\nHostacerin SAF...3,0%\r\nBase Vitessence TRD qsp 15g\r\nModo de uso: lave o rosto e aplique-o duas vezes ao dia,\r\nantes dos cremes do Dia e da Noite.\r\n',NULL,'freitasadm',NULL,'pH: o ROZEX gel tem pH 4,5, mas a Cláudia achava que tinha que der pH mais neutro (sic)\r\nMetronidazol dose diaria 