 Daniella Borin Bellini, has a very sensitive and dry skin, which becomes parched and subject to ailments if not properly hydrated and protected. \r\nMs. Bellini has undergone several treatment trials in the past, which were of no avail due to her very specific needs and her allergy to most skin products.\r\nThe attached prescription is the only one that has been effective and that that has not caused any allergy or adverse reactions in the patient. \r\nFor that reason, Ms. Bellini should continue to use it without interruption.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\n\r\nLuiz Freitas, MD\r\nfreitasdr@uol.com.br\r\n+55 19 998417729\r\n',NULL,'mmicheloto',NULL,'',0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL),(3390,_binary '\0','z-declaracao-CAPILAR-non-flammable','z-declaracao-CAPILAR-non-flammable',NULL,'2024-10-02 15:32:52','\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n                                                        Medical Statement\r\n\r\nI was asked to inform about Mr. Julio Cesar Shirano Scagliarini\'s scalp lotion, whether it is flammable and appropriate for air shipping. I herein declare that it is not flammable, as it is just a water-based product and has no flammable ingredients.\r\nMr. Scagliarini has very sensitive and dry scalp skin, which becomes parched and subject to ailments if not properly hydrated and protected while at the same time he is treating for hair loss.\r\nMr. Scagliarini s. Bellini has undergone several treatment trials in the past, which were of no avail due to her very specific needs and her allergy to most skin and scalp products.\r\nThis lotion is the only one that has been effective and that that has not caused any allergy or adverse reactions in the patient. \r\nFor that reason, Mr. Scagliarini should continue to use it without interruption.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\n\r\nLuiz Freitas, MD\r\nfreitasdr@uol.com.br\r\n+55 19 998417729\r\n',NULL,'mmicheloto',NULL,'',0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL),(3391,_binary '\0','z-declaracao-e-receita-M-AX-100ML','z-declaracao-e-receita-M-AX-100ML',NULL,'2020-06-29 19:35:43','Scalp soothing lotion\n\nD-pantenol 1%\nVitessence Pro Capilar qs  \nCapilvelt Pro FC 5%\nCapilvelt GF Acqua Plus 15%\nMinoxidil 5%\nAuxina tricogena 7,0%\nPurified water serum qsp...100mL  Prepare 2 plastic bottles.\nApply on the scalp once or twice a day to alleviate dry scalp symptoms. \nPress the pump 6 times on the desired area, or on the top of the head, and spread the watery lotion using your fingers, smoothly. The interruption of the use should be avoided in order not to lose the obtained benefits.\n',NULL,'freitasadm',NULL,'',0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL),(3395,_binary '\0','zzzzzz-SUICO-G30','029C',NULL,'2025-02-24 19:47:17','Creme Suiço Ultra Hidratante \r\n\r\nInnovare 6,0%\r\nB. Hydraction Suisse qsp 30g\r\nAplicar 1 a 3 x/dia nas áreas ressecadas de face, pescoço e colo.\r\nA noite, use sobre o cr. da noite, ou sozinho.\r\nDe dia, use embaixo do cr. do dia, ou sozinho\r\n',NULL,'freitasadm',NULL,'',0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL),(3399,_binary '\0','Z-PEELING-RETINOICO_5%+TON_1,5+FPS50-15G','PEELING RETINOICO_5%+TON_1,5+FPS50-15G',NULL,'2023-11-14 21:04:51','Máscara/Peeling Ác. Retinóico 5,0% FPS50\nBASE TOM CLARO Nº 1,5 \n\nTretinoina 5,0%\nClearvelt qs\nPropilenoglicol qs\nSepigel 0,5%\nNeolipossome VC 6,0%\nB. Hidraintense qs\nFPS50-Tonalité 1  50%\nFPS50-Tonalité 2 qs 15g\nModo de uso: seguir de forma rigorosa a orientação \nmédica. Caso haja dúvidas sobre o uso, não o utilize.\n-Conservar em geladeira-',NULL,'freitasadm',NULL,'',0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL),(3401,_binary '\0','ZZ-OLHOS-3-HYALU-D','OLHOS-3-HYALU-D',NULL,'2023-03-10 17:19:34','Olhos Anti-Age Hyalu Firmador\n\nHydra Intense 6,0%\nB. Eyecontour Hyalu D qsp 15g\nUsar sobre os cremes do Dia e da Noite. \nAplicar nas pálpebras inferiores, na lateral dos olhos, \nao redor dos lábios e entre as sobrancelhas\n',NULL,'freitasadm',NULL,'',0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL),(3403,_binary 