orosa a orientação \r\nmédica. Caso haja dúvidas sobre o uso, não o utilize.\r\n-Conservar em geladeira-\r\n',NULL,'mmicheloto',NULL,'',0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL),(3409,_binary '\0','PSDIN-80','CQPSDIN-80',NULL,'2020-10-25 12:18:19','Protetor Solar FPS-80 Hidratante e Rejuvenescedor\n\nFiltro 80 Pele Seca - Hidratante\nFPS80 Anti-UVA/B\nB. Nutradvance 6,0%\nB. Hydramince 1A qsp 50g\nAplique na face, pescoço e colo. Use duas vezes ao dia, \npela manhã e após o almoço. Se for ao sol, reaplique a cada 2 \nhoras.',NULL,'freitasadm',NULL,'',0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL),(3411,_binary '\0','UHDIN3-50','CQUHDIN3-50',NULL,'2020-08-23 18:31:21','Creme do Dia Ultra-Hidratante\n\nDia Ultra Hidratante FPS50\nFPS50 anti-UVA/B  \nB. Hidra Intense 6,0%\nB. Hydraction-plus 25%\nB. Dynamisée 1A qsp 50g\nAplicar na face, pescoço e colo. Usar 2 vezes ao dia, \npela manhã e após o almoço. Se for ao sol, reaplique de 2 / 2 \nhoras',NULL,'freitasadm',NULL,'',0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL),(3413,_binary '','NOITE MAOS R0,035H12','MAOS-NOITE-R0,035H12-DYN3',NULL,'2026-05-11 20:17:12','Creme Mãos Noite Rejuvenescedor\r\n\r\nTretinoína 0,035%\r\nHidroquisan 12%\r\nVitessence 6,0%\r\nNeolipossome VC qs\r\nB. Hydraction Suisse 30,0%\r\nB. Neodeline Nutrissome qsp 30g\r\nUso: aplicar fina camada a noite nas mãos e antebraços. Inicie alternando as noites conforme orientação. Se ocorrer \r\nvermelhidão, interrompa o uso e contate-nos.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n',NULL,'freitasadm',NULL,'',0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL),(3415,_binary '\0','MAOS-R0,025M8-DIN3','CQMAOS-R2,5M8-DIN3',NULL,'2024-10-02 14:53:38','Creme da Noite das Mãos\r\n\r\nTretinoína 0,025%\r\nHidroquisan 8%\r\nHydraction-plus 30,0%\r\nLumine-C Nano Vitamina C 6,0%\r\nNeolipossome VC qs\r\nBase Neodeline Nutrissome qsp 30g\r\nUso: inicie alternando as noites conforme orientação. Se ocorrer \r\nvermelhidão, interrompa o uso e contate-nos.\r\n',NULL,'mmicheloto',NULL,'',0.00,0.00,N